Traits: report TraitsUpdated when no custom trait differs

TraitsController.Reconcile in internal/controller/traits_controller.go
returns without setting a condition when spec.customTraits equals the
custom traits of status.traits. The TraitsUpdated condition is set only
on the path that calls Placement, so only when a trait differs. In the
Handover phase OnboardingController.completeOnboarding and the
aggregates controller both wait for TraitsUpdated=True. A node without
the nova.openstack.cloud.sap/custom-traits annotation has
spec.customTraits: [], nothing ever differs, and onboarding stops at
Handover until a custom trait is created in Placement and annotated on
the node.

When nothing differs and the condition is not True yet, the controller
now sets TraitsUpdated=True with reason Succeeded and the message
"Custom traits are in sync" without calling Placement. status.traits is
not written on that path. Once the condition is True, a repeat returns
without a write.

No upstream test covers a Hypervisor whose traits are in sync. The
patch adds TestTraitsInSyncSetsTraitsUpdated, a plain Go test outside
the Ginkgo suite with controller-runtime's fake client and no
Placement client, so it runs without envtest and proves that no
Placement call happens; the CobaltCore image build runs it and fails
when it does not pass.

Applies-to: cobaltcore-dev/openstack-hypervisor-operator main @ a2baf3f4002e39ff93f105fae9594b357ba55b21

Upstream status: not submitted

diff --git a/internal/controller/traits_controller.go b/internal/controller/traits_controller.go
index b079676..7ca2128 100644
--- a/internal/controller/traits_controller.go
+++ b/internal/controller/traits_controller.go
@@ -92,8 +92,14 @@ func (tc *TraitsController) Reconcile(ctx context.Context, req ctrl.Request) (ct
 	})
 
 	if slices.Equal(hv.Spec.CustomTraits, customTraitsApplied) {
-		// Nothing to be done
-		return ctrl.Result{}, nil
+		if meta.IsStatusConditionTrue(hv.Status.Conditions, kvmv1.ConditionTypeTraitsUpdated) {
+			return ctrl.Result{}, nil
+		}
+		// Nothing differs, so Placement is not called. Onboarding and the
+		// aggregates controller still wait for the condition.
+		return ctrl.Result{}, utils.PatchHypervisorStatusWithRetry(ctx, tc.Client, hv.Name, TraitsControllerName, func(h *kvmv1.Hypervisor) {
+			meta.SetStatusCondition(&h.Status.Conditions, getTraitCondition(nil, "Custom traits are in sync"))
+		})
 	}
 
 	toAdd := utils.Difference(customTraitsApplied, hv.Spec.CustomTraits)
